# Allow-list. The repo holds the P300 baseline pipeline, its figure and QC scripts, and its docs.
# Everything else in this working tree stays local: EEG data (BIDS release on GIN), participant
# metadata, caches, result tables, figures, plans and the other analysis scripts.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/requirements.txt
!/analysis/
/analysis/*
!/analysis/p300_baseline_v3.py
!/analysis/multisite_data.py
!/analysis/baseline_figures.py
!/analysis/mastoid_qc.py
!/analysis/mastoid_position_check.py
!/analysis/mastoid_reference_check.py
!/analysis/mastoid_figures.py
__pycache__/
